  149\\t| night_owl               | special    | Learn after midnight                  | 50       |\\n   150\\t| speed_learner           | special    | Complete quiz in <30 seconds          | 75       |\\n   151\\t| collector_complete      | special    | 100% collection (162 motifs)          | 2000     |\\n   152\\t```\\n   153\\t\\n   154\\t#### B.3 Badge API Endpoints\\n   155\\t```\\n   156\\tREQ-BADGE-002: GET /api/v1/users/me/badges\\n   157\\t├── WHEN a user requests their badges\\n   158\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   159\\t│   ├── earned: array of { badge, earned_at }\\n   160\\t│   ├── available: array of { badge, progress, criteria }\\n   161\\t│   └── total_badge_xp: int\\n   162\\t└── Group by category for display\\n   163\\t\\n   164\\tREQ-BADGE-003: GET /api/v1/badges\\n   165\\t├── WHEN anyone requests badge catalog\\n   166\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return all badges with:\\n   167\\t│   ├── slug, name, name_en, description\\n   168\\t│   ├── icon_url, category\\n   169\\t│   └── is_hidden (for secret badges)\\n   170\\t└── Hidden badges show \\\"???\\\" until earned\\n   171\\t\\n   172\\tREQ-BADGE-004: POST /api/v1/badges/check (Internal)\\n   173\\t├── WHEN any XP-awarding action completes\\n   174\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n   175\\t│   ├── Query all unearned badges for user\\n   176\\t│   ├── Check each badge's criteria\\n   177\\t│   ├── Award badge if criteria met\\n   178\\t│   └── Return newly earned badges for notification\\n   179\\t└── Run as background task (async)\\n   180\\t```\\n   181\\t\\n   182\\t---\\n   183\\t\\n   184\\t### 2.3 DOMAIN C: LEADERBOARD SYSTEM\\n   185\\t\\n   186\\t#### C.1 Leaderboard Retrieval\\n   187\\t```\\n   188\\tREQ-LEAD-001: GET /api/v1/leaderboard\\n   189\\t├── WHEN a user requests leaderboard\\n   190\\t├── WITH query params:\\n   191\\t│   ├── period: all_time | weekly | monthly (default: all_time)\\n   192\\t│   ├── limit: int (default: 50, max: 100)\\n   193\\t│   └── offset: int (default: 0)\\n   194\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   195\\t│   ├── entries: array of { rank, user_id, display_name, avatar_url, total_xp, level }\\n   196\\t│   ├── current_user: { rank, total_xp } (even if not in top)\\n   197\\t│   └── total_users: int\\n   198\\t└── Order by total_xp DESC, created_at ASC (tiebreaker)\\n   199\\t```\\n   200\\t\\n   201\\t#### C.2 Weekly/Monthly Reset Logic\\n   202\\t```\\n   203\\tREQ-LEAD-002: Periodic Leaderboard Calculation\\n   204\\t├── WHEN period=weekly requested\\n   205\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n   206\\t│   ├── Sum XP earned from QuizAttempts where created_at >= week_start\\n   207\\t│   ├── Add XP from UserProgress updates in same period\\n   208\\t│   └── Cache result for 5 minutes\\n   209\\t└── Weekly resets: Monday 00:00 UTC+7\\n   210\\t```\\n   211\\t\\n   212\\t---\\n   213\\t\\n   214\\t### 2.4 DOMAIN D: STREAK SYSTEM\\n   215\\t\\n   216\\t#### D.1 Streak Calculation\\n   217\\t```\\n   218\\tREQ-STREAK-001: Streak Update Logic\\n   219\\t├── WHEN a user performs any learning activity:\\n   220\\t│   ├── Discovers a motif\\n   221\\t│   ├── Completes a lesson\\n   222\\t│   ├── Submits a quiz\\n   223\\t│   └── Views lesson content\\n   224\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n   225\\t│   ├── Check if user has activity today (UTC+7)\\n   226\\t│   ├── IF first activity today:\\n   227\\t│   │   ├── IF yesterday had activity: current_streak += 1\\n   228\\t│   │   ├── ELSE IF missed 1 day AND has freeze: use freeze, keep streak\\n   229\\t│   │   └── ELSE: current_streak = 1\\n   230\\t│   ├── Update longest_streak if current > longest\\n   231\\t│   └── Update last_active_at = now()\\n   232\\t└── Store last_streak_date in user record\\n   233\\t```\\n   234\\t\\n   235\\t#### D.2 Streak API\\n   236\\t```\\n   237\\tREQ-STREAK-002: GET /api/v1/users/me/streak\\n   238\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   239\\t│   ├── current_streak: int\\n   240\\t│   ├── longest_streak: int\\n   241\\t│   ├── last_active_date: date\\n   242\\t│   ├── streak_freezes_available: int (max 2)\\n   243\\t│   ├── streak_at_risk: bool (true if no activity today and streak > 0)\\n   244\\t│   └── days_until_next_badge: int\\n   245\\t└── Include streak badge progress\\n   246\\t\\n   247\\tREQ-STREAK-003: POST /api/v1/users/me/streak/freeze\\n   248\\t├── WHEN user activates streak freeze\\n   249\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n   250\\t│   ├── Decrement streak_freezes_available\\n   251\\t│   ├── Set streak_frozen_until = tomorrow\\n   252\\t│   └── Return updated streak info\\n   253\\t└── IF no freezes available THEN return 400\\n   254\\t```\\n   255\\t\\n   256\\t---\\n   257\\t\\n   258\\t### 2.5 DOMAIN E: URN & MOTIF APIS\\n   259\\t\\n   260\\t#### E.1 Urns Listing\\n   261\\t```\\n   262\\tREQ-URN-001: GET /api/v1/urns\\n   263\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return all 9 urns with:\\n   264\\t│   ├── id, slug, name, name_han\\n   265\\t│   ├── represents, description\\n   266\\t│   ├── thumbnail_url, model_url\\n   267\\t│   ├── display_order\\n   268\\t│   ├── motif_count: int (total)\\n   269\\t│   └── user_progress: { discovered, learned, mastered } (if authenticated)\\n   270\\t└── Order by display_order ASC\\n   271\\t```\\n   272\\t\\n   273\\t#### E.2 Single Urn Detail\\n   274\\t```\\n   275\\tREQ-URN-002: GET /api/v1/urns/{slug}\\n   276\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return urn detail with:\\n   277\\t│   ├── All fields from URN-001\\n   278\\t│   ├── motifs: array (with progress status if authenticated)\\n   279\\t│   └── completion_percentage: float\\n   280\\t└── IF not found THEN return 404\\n   281\\t```\\n   282\\t\\n   283\\t#### E.3 Motif Detail\\n   284\\t```\\n   285\\tREQ-MOTIF-001: GET /api/v1/motifs/{motif_id}\\n   286\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   287\\t│   ├── id, urn_id, mesh_name, name, name_en\\n   288\\t│   ├── category, rarity\\n   289\\t│   ├── pos_x, pos_y, pos_z, bounding_radius\\n   290\\t│   ├── cam_pos_x, cam_pos_y, cam_pos_z\\n   291\\t│   ├── cam_look_at_x, cam_look_at_y, cam_look_at_z\\n   292\\t│   ├── thumbnail_url, silhouette_url\\n   293\\t│   ├── lesson: { intro_text, description, historical_context, symbolism, fun_fact }\\n   294\\t│   ├── quiz_question_count: int\\n   295\\t│   └── user_progress: { status, discovered_at, learned_at, mastered_at, xp_earned }\\n   296\\t└── Return silhouette_url only if not discovered\\n   297\\t```\\n   298\\t\\n   299\\t#### E.4 Motif Search\\n   300\\t```\\n   301\\tREQ-MOTIF-002: GET /api/v1/motifs/search\\n   302\\t├── WITH query params:\\n   303\\t│   ├── q: string (search name, name_en, description)\\n   304\\t│   ├── category: enum (optional)\\n   305\\t│   ├── rarity: enum (optional)\\n   306\\t│   ├── urn_id: UUID (optional)\\n   307\\t│   └── limit, offset\\n   308\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return matching motifs\\n   309\\t└── Use PostgreSQL full-text search (ts_vector)\\n   310\\t```\\n   311\\t\\n   312\\t---\\n   313\\t\\n   314\\t### 2.6 DOMAIN F: COLLECTION (Pokédex)\\n   315\\t\\n   316\\t#### F.1 Full Collection View\\n   317\\t```\\n   318\\tREQ-COLL-001: GET /api/v1/users/me/collection\\n   319\\t├── ALREADY IMPLEMENTED (partial)\\n   320\\t├── ENHANCE to include:\\n   321\\t│   ├── Filter by: urn_slug, category, rarity, status\\n   322\\t│   ├── Sort by: discovered_at, name, rarity\\n   323\\t│   └── Pagination: limit, offset\\n   324\\t└── Return silhouette for undiscovered\\n   325\\t```\\n   326\\t\\n   327\\t#### F.2 Collection Statistics\\n   328\\t```\\n   329\\tREQ-COLL-002: GET /api/v1/users/me/collection/stats\\n   330\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   331\\t│   ├── total_motifs: 162\\n   332\\t│   ├── discovered: int, learned: int, mastered: int\\n   333\\t│   ├── by_urn: array of { urn_slug, total, discovered, learned, mastered }\\n   334\\t│   ├── by_category: array of { category, total, discovered, learned, mastered }\\n   335\\t│   ├── by_rarity: array of { rarity, total, discovered }\\n   336\\t│   └── completion_percentage: float\\n   337\\t└── Cache result for 1 minute\\n   338\\t```\\n   339\\t\\n   340\\t---\\n   341\\t\\n   342\\t### 2.7 DOMAIN G: USER PROFILE\\n   343\\t\\n   344\\t#### G.1 Profile Detail\\n   345\\t```\\n   346\\tREQ-PROF-001: GET /api/v1/users/me/profile\\n   347\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   348\\t│   ├── user: { id, email, display_name, avatar_url, role, created_at }\\n   349\\t│   ├── stats: { total_xp, rank, xp_to_next_rank }\\n   350\\t│   ├── streak: { current, longest, last_active }\\n   351\\t│   ├── collection: { discovered, learned, mastered, total }\\n   352\\t│   ├── badges: { earned_count, recent_badges }\\n   353\\t│   ├── quiz: { attempts, avg_score, perfect_count }\\n   354\\t│   └── activity: { days_active, favorite_urn, favorite_category }\\n   355\\t└── Aggregate from multiple tables\\n   356\\t```\\n   357\\t\\n   358\\t#### G.2 Profile Update\\n   359\\t```\\n   360\\tREQ-PROF-002: PATCH /api/v1/users/me/profile\\n   361\\t├── WITH payload:\\n   362\\t│   ├── display_name: string (optional)\\n   363\\t│   └── avatar_url: string (optional)\\n   364\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL validate and update\\n   365\\t└── Return updated profile\\n   366\\t```\\n   367\\t\\n   368\\t#### G.3 Public Profile (Optional)\\n   369\\t```\\n   370\\tREQ-PROF-003: GET /api/v1/users/{user_id}/public\\n   371\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return (if user allows):\\n   372\\t│   ├── display_name, avatar_url\\n   373\\t│   ├── rank, total_xp\\n   374\\t│   ├── badges (public only)\\n   375\\t│   └── collection_count\\n   376\\t└── Hide if user.is_public = false\\n   377\\t```\\n   378\\t\\n   379\\t---\\n   380\\t\\n   381\\t### 2.8 DOMAIN H: ADMIN PANEL\\n   382\\t\\n   383\\t#### H.1 Access Control\\n   384\\t```\\n   385\\tREQ-ADMIN-001: Admin Role Check\\n   386\\t├── WHEN any /api/v1/admin/* endpoint is called\\n   387\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n   388\\t│   ├── Verify Authorization header\\n   389\\t│   ├── Check user.role in (admin, super_admin)\\n   390\\t│   └── IF not authorized THEN return 403\\n   391\\t└── Log all admin actions\\n   392\\t```\\n   393\\t\\n   394\\t#### H.2 Motif Management\\n   395\\t```\\n   396\\tREQ-ADMIN-002: CRUD /api/v1/admin/motifs\\n   397\\t├── GET /: List all motifs with pagination\\n   398\\t├── GET /{id}: Get motif detail (including inactive)\\n   399\\t├── POST /: Create new motif\\n   400\\t│   ├── Required: urn_id, mesh_name, name, category\\n   401\\t│   └── Optional: all other fields\\n   402\\t├── PUT /{id}: Update motif\\n   403\\t├── DELETE /{id}: Soft delete (is_active = false)\\n   404\\t└── POST /{id}/restore: Restore deleted motif\\n   405\\t```\\n   406\\t\\n   407\\t#### H.3 Quiz Question Management\\n   408\\t```\\n   409\\tREQ-ADMIN-003: CRUD /api/v1/admin/quiz-questions\\n   410\\t├── GET /: List questions with filters\\n   411\\t├── POST /: Create question\\n   412\\t│   ├── Required: motif_id, question_type, question_text, correct_answer\\n   413\\t│   └── For multiple_choice: options array (4 items)\\n   414\\t├── PUT /{id}: Update question\\n   415\\t└── DELETE /{id}: Soft delete\\n   416\\t```\\n   417\\t\\n   418\\t#### H.4 User Management\\n   419\\t```\\n   420\\tREQ-ADMIN-004: /api/v1/admin/users (super_admin only)\\n   421\\t├── GET /: List users with filters (role, search)\\n   422\\t├── GET /{id}: User detail with full stats\\n   423\\t├── PATCH /{id}/role: Change user role\\n   424\\t├── POST /{id}/ban: Ban user (role → banned)\\n   425\\t└── POST /{id}/reset-password: Send password reset\\n   426\\t```\\n   427\\t\\n   428\\t#### H.5 Analytics Dashboard\\n   429\\t```\\n   430\\tREQ-ADMIN-005: GET /api/v1/admin/analytics\\n   431\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   432\\t│   ├── user_stats: { total, active_today, active_week, new_this_month }\\n   433\\t│   ├── learning_stats: { discoveries_today, quizzes_today, avg_score }\\n   434\\t│   ├── content_stats: { motifs_total, motifs_with_lesson, questions_total }\\n   435\\t│   ├── engagement: { avg_session_time, retention_7d, top_motifs }\\n   436\\t│   └── period_comparison: { xp_this_week vs last_week }\\n   437\\t└── Cache for 5 minutes\\n   438\\t```\\n   439\\t\\n   440\\t---\\n   441\\t\\n   442\\t### 2.9 DOMAIN I: INFRASTRUCTURE & TESTING\\n   443\\t\\n   444\\t#### I.1 Database Migrations\\n   445\\t```\\n   446\\tREQ-INFRA-001: Alembic Setup\\n   447\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL use Alembic for migrations\\n   448\\t├── WITH:\\n   449\\t│   ├── alembic.ini configured for PostgreSQL\\n   450\\t│   ├── migrations/ folder with version scripts\\n   451\\t│   └── alembic upgrade head in deploy script\\n   452\\t└── NO more Base.metadata.create_all() in production\\n   453\\t```\\n   454\\t\\n   455\\t#### I.2 Testing Framework\\n   456\\t```\\n   457\\tREQ-TEST-001: Backend Testing\\n   458\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL include:\\n   459\\t│   ├── pytest as test runner\\n   460\\t│   ├── pytest-asyncio for async tests\\n   461\\t│   ├── httpx for API testing\\n   462\\t│   ├── factory_boy for test data\\n   463\\t│   └── pytest-cov for coverage\\n   464\\t├── Coverage targets:\\n   465\\t│   ├── Overall: >= 60%\\n   466\\t│   ├── API routes: >= 80%\\n   467\\t│   └── Models: >= 70%\\n   468\\t└── Test database: SQLite in-memory or Docker PostgreSQL\\n   469\\t```\\n   470\\t\\n   471\\t#### I.3 CI/CD Pipeline\\n   472\\t```\\n   473\\tREQ-INFRA-002: GitHub Actions\\n   474\\t├── .github/workflows/ci.yml:\\n   475\\t│   ├── Trigger: push/PR to main\\n   476\\t│   ├── Jobs: lint, typecheck, test, build\\n   477\\t│   └── Matrix: Python 3.11, Node 20\\n   478\\t├── .github/workflows/deploy-staging.yml:\\n   479\\t│   └── Deploy to staging on main push\\n   480\\t└── .github/workflows/deploy-production.yml:\\n   481\\t    └── Deploy to prod on release tag\\n   482\\t```\\n   483\\t\\n   484\\t---\\n   485\\t\\n   486\\t## 3. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\\n   487\\t\\n   488\\t### 3.1 Performance\\n   489\\t```\\n   490\\tNFR-PERF-001: API response time < 200ms (p95) for list endpoints\\n   491\\tNFR-PERF-002: API response time < 100ms (p95) for single resource\\n   492\\tNFR-PERF-003: 3D model initial load < 3 seconds on 4G connection\\n   493\\tNFR-PERF-004: Leaderboard query < 50ms with caching\\n   494\\t```\\n   495\\t\\n   496\\t### 3.2 Security\\n   497\\t```\\n   498\\tNFR-SEC-001: All passwords hashed with bcrypt (rounds=12)\\n   499\\tNFR-SEC-002: JWT tokens expire (access: 60min, refresh: 30days)\\n   500\\tNFR-SEC-003: Rate limiting: 100 requests/minute per IP\\n   501\\tNFR-SEC-004: Input validation on all endpoints\\n   502\\tNFR-SEC-005: SQL injection prevention via ORM\\n   503\\t```\\n   504\\t\\n   505\\t### 3.3 Reliability\\n   506\\t```\\n   507\\tNFR-REL-001: 99.9% uptime target\\n   508\\tNFR-REL-002: Graceful degradation when 3D models fail to load\\n   509\\tNFR-REL-003: Retry logic for API calls (3 attempts)\\n   510\\t```\\n   511\\t\\n   512\\t---\\n   513\\t\\n   514\\t## 4. ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA SUMMARY\\n   515\\t\\n   516\\t| Domain | Criteria | Measurement |\\n   517\\t|--------|----------|-------------|\\n   518\\t| Quiz | User can complete quiz and see results | Manual test |\\n   519\\t| Badges | Badges auto-awarded when criteria met | Unit test |\\n   520\\t| Leaderboard | Top 50 users displayed with current user rank | Manual test |\\n   521\\t| Streak | Streak increments daily on activity | Integration test |\\n   522\\t| Collection | Filter/sort works, silhouettes for hidden | Manual test |\\n   523\\t| Admin | CRUD operations work for admin users | Integration test |\\n   524\\t| Tests | Coverage >= 60% | CI pipeline |\\n   525\\t\\n   526\\t---\\n   527\\t\\n   528\\t**END OF PHASE 1 DOCUMENT**\\n   529\\t\\nTotal lines in file: 529\\n\"}\n    242\t```\n    243\t\n...\n    251\t\n    252\t```json\n>   253\t{\"output\":\"Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /root/luuniensuki-lms/docs/plan/01_Backend_API_Backlog.md:\\n     1\\t# 01_Backend_API_Backlog.md\\n     2\\t\\n     3\\t## Goal\\n     4\\t\\n     5\\tBring the FastAPI backend from “auth + unlock” t