    33\\t├── Error Handling: HTTPException with status codes\\n    34\\t├── Auth: JWT (access + refresh tokens)\\n    35\\t└── Database: SQLAlchemy 2.0 with Mapped[] type hints\\n    36\\t\\n    37\\tFrontend (Next.js 15):\\n    38\\t├── State: Zustand with persist middleware\\n    39\\t├── API: fetch wrapper with token injection\\n    40\\t├── Routing: App Router (/app directory)\\n    41\\t├── Styling: Tailwind CSS\\n    42\\t└── 3D: React Three Fiber + Drei\\n    43\\t```\\n    44\\t\\n    45\\t---\\n    46\\t\\n    47\\t## 2. DETAILED REQUIREMENTS (EARS Notation)\\n    48\\t\\n    49\\t### 2.1 DOMAIN A: QUIZ SYSTEM\\n    50\\t\\n    51\\t#### A.1 Quiz Question Retrieval\\n    52\\t```\\n    53\\tREQ-QUIZ-001: GET /api/v1/motifs/{motif_id}/quiz\\n    54\\t├── WHEN a user requests quiz for a motif\\n    55\\t├── AND the user has discovered this motif (status >= discovered)\\n    56\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return quiz questions with:\\n    57\\t│   ├── question_id: UUID\\n    58\\t│   ├── question_type: enum (multiple_choice|true_false|image_select|mesh_location)\\n    59\\t│   ├── question_text: string\\n    60\\t│   ├── options: array (shuffled, 4 items for multiple_choice)\\n    61\\t│   ├── difficulty: int (1-5)\\n    62\\t│   └── target_mesh_name: string (for mesh_location type only)\\n    63\\t├── AND shuffle options order randomly\\n    64\\t└── IF user has not discovered motif THEN return 403 Forbidden\\n    65\\t```\\n    66\\t\\n    67\\t#### A.2 Quiz Submission\\n    68\\t```\\n    69\\tREQ-QUIZ-002: POST /api/v1/quiz/submit\\n    70\\t├── WHEN a user submits quiz answers\\n    71\\t├── WITH payload:\\n    72\\t│   ├── motif_id: UUID\\n    73\\t│   ├── answers: array of { question_id: UUID, answer: string }\\n    74\\t│   └── time_taken_seconds: int\\n    75\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n    76\\t│   ├── Validate each answer against correct_answer\\n    77\\t│   ├── Calculate score percentage\\n    78\\t│   ├── Create QuizAttempt record\\n    79\\t│   ├── Award XP based on score:\\n    80\\t│   │   ├── score >= 70%: +100 XP, status → learned\\n    81\\t│   │   ├── score = 100%: +50 XP bonus, status → mastered\\n    82\\t│   │   └── score < 70%: +10 XP (participation)\\n    83\\t│   └── Return detailed results with explanations\\n    84\\t└── RESPONSE:\\n    85\\t    ├── attempt_id: UUID\\n    86\\t    ├── score: float (0.0-1.0)\\n    87\\t    ├── xp_earned: int\\n    88\\t    ├── new_status: enum\\n    89\\t    ├── results: array of { question_id, correct, user_answer, correct_answer, explanation }\\n    90\\t    └── badges_earned: array (if any)\\n    91\\t```\\n    92\\t\\n    93\\t#### A.3 Lesson Completion\\n    94\\t```\\n    95\\tREQ-QUIZ-003: POST /api/v1/motifs/{motif_id}/complete-lesson\\n    96\\t├── WHEN a user completes reading lesson content\\n    97\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n    98\\t│   ├── Update UserProgress.lesson_viewed_at = now()\\n    99\\t│   ├── Return quiz_unlocked: true\\n   100\\t│   └── Award +10 XP for lesson completion\\n   101\\t└── IF lesson already viewed THEN skip XP award\\n   102\\t```\\n   103\\t\\n   104\\t#### A.4 Quiz History\\n   105\\t```\\n   106\\tREQ-QUIZ-004: GET /api/v1/users/me/quiz-history\\n   107\\t├── WHEN a user requests their quiz history\\n   108\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return paginated list of attempts:\\n   109\\t│   ├── attempt_id, motif_id, motif_name\\n   110\\t│   ├── score, xp_earned, passed (bool)\\n   111\\t│   ├── time_taken_seconds\\n   112\\t│   └── created_at\\n   113\\t└── SUPPORT query params: ?motif_id=&limit=20&offset=0\\n   114\\t```\\n   115\\t\\n   116\\t---\\n   117\\t\\n   118\\t### 2.2 DOMAIN B: GAMIFICATION (Badges & Achievements)\\n   119\\t\\n   120\\t#### B.1 Badge Definitions (Seed Data)\\n   121\\t```\\n   122\\tREQ-BADGE-001: Badge Categories\\n   123\\t├── discovery: First discoveries, exploration milestones\\n   124\\t├── collection: Collection completion (per urn, per category)\\n   125\\t├── mastery: Quiz performance, perfect scores\\n   126\\t├── streak: Daily activity consistency\\n   127\\t└── special: Hidden achievements, events\\n   128\\t```\\n   129\\t\\n   130\\t#### B.2 Badge Criteria Table\\n   131\\t```\\n   132\\t| Badge Slug              | Category   | Criteria                           | XP Bonus |\\n   133\\t|-------------------------|------------|---------------------------------------|----------|\\n   134\\t| first_discovery         | discovery  | Discover 1 motif                      | 50       |\\n   135\\t| explorer_10             | discovery  | Discover 10 motifs                    | 100      |\\n   136\\t| explorer_50             | discovery  | Discover 50 motifs                    | 250      |\\n   137\\t| explorer_100            | discovery  | Discover 100 motifs                   | 500      |\\n   138\\t| cao_complete            | collection | All motifs in Cao Đỉnh                | 200      |\\n   139\\t| nhan_complete           | collection | All motifs in Nhân Đỉnh               | 200      |\\n   140\\t| ... (all 9 urns)        | collection | ...                                   | 200      |\\n   141\\t| linh_thu_master         | collection | All Linh Thú category                 | 300      |\\n   142\\t| thao_moc_master         | collection | All Thảo Mộc category                 | 300      |\\n   143\\t| ... (all 9 categories)  | collection | ...                                   | 300      |\\n   144\\t| quiz_perfect_1          | mastery    | 1 perfect quiz score                  | 75       |\\n   145\\t| quiz_perfect_10         | mastery    | 10 perfect quiz scores                | 200      |\\n   146\\t| streak_7                | streak     | 7-day streak                          | 100      |\\n   147\\t| streak_30               | streak     | 30-day streak                         | 500      |\\n   148\\t| streak_100              | streak     | 100-day streak                        | 1000     |\\n   149\\t| night_owl               | special    | Learn after midnight                  | 50       |\\n   150\\t| speed_learner           | special    | Complete quiz in <30 seconds          | 75       |\\n   151\\t| collector_complete      | special    | 100% collection (162 motifs)          | 2000     |\\n   152\\t```\\n   153\\t\\n   154\\t#### B.3 Badge API Endpoints\\n   155\\t```\\n   156\\tREQ-BADGE-002: GET /api/v1/users/me/badges\\n   157\\t├── WHEN a user requests their badges\\n   158\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   159\\t│   ├── earned: array of { badge, earned_at }\\n   160\\t│   ├── available: array of { badge, progress, criteria }\\n   161\\t│   └── total_badge_xp: int\\n   162\\t└── Group by category for display\\n   163\\t\\n   164\\tREQ-BADGE-003: GET /api/v1/badges\\n   165\\t├── WHEN anyone requests badge catalog\\n   166\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return all badges with:\\n   167\\t│   ├── slug, name, name_en, description\\n   168\\t│   ├── icon_url, category\\n   169\\t│   └── is_hidden (for secret badges)\\n   170\\t└── Hidden badges show \\\"???\\\" until earned\\n   171\\t\\n   172\\tREQ-BADGE-004: POST /api/v1/badges/check (Internal)\\n   173\\t├── WHEN any XP-awarding action completes\\n   174\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n   175\\t│   ├── Query all unearned badges for user\\n   176\\t│   ├── Check each badge's criteria\\n   177\\t│   ├── Award badge if criteria met\\n   178\\t│   └── Return newly earned badges for notification\\n   179\\t└── Run as background task (async)\\n   180\\t```\\n   181\\t\\n   182\\t---\\n   183\\t\\n   184\\t### 2.3 DOMAIN C: LEADERBOARD SYSTEM\\n   185\\t\\n   186\\t#### C.1 Leaderboard Retrieval\\n   187\\t```\\n   188\\tREQ-LEAD-001: GET /api/v1/leaderboard\\n   189\\t├── WHEN a user requests leaderboard\\n   190\\t├── WITH query params:\\n   191\\t│   ├── period: all_time | weekly | monthly (default: all_time)\\n   192\\t│   ├── limit: int (default: 50, max: 100)\\n   193\\t│   └── offset: int (default: 0)\\n   194\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   195\\t│   ├── entries: array of { rank, user_id, display_name, avatar_url, total_xp, level }\\n   196\\t│   ├── current_user: { rank, total_xp } (even if not in top)\\n   197\\t│   └── total_users: int\\n   198\\t└── Order by total_xp DESC, created_at ASC (tiebreaker)\\n   199\\t```\\n   200\\t\\n   201\\t#### C.2 Weekly/Monthly Reset Logic\\n   202\\t```\\n   203\\tREQ-LEAD-002: Periodic Leaderboard Calculation\\n   204\\t├── WHEN period=weekly requested\\n   205\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n   206\\t│   ├── Sum XP earned from QuizAttempts where created_at >= week_start\\n   207\\t│   ├── Add XP from UserProgress updates in same period\\n   208\\t│   └── Cache result for 5 minutes\\n   209\\t└── Weekly resets: Monday 00:00 UTC+7\\n   210\\t```\\n   211\\t\\n   212\\t---\\n   213\\t\\n   214\\t### 2.4 DOMAIN D: STREAK SYSTEM\\n   215\\t\\n   216\\t#### D.1 Streak Calculation\\n   217\\t```\\n   218\\tREQ-STREAK-001: Streak Update Logic\\n   219\\t├── WHEN a user performs any learning activity:\\n   220\\t│   ├── Discovers a motif\\n   221\\t│   ├── Completes a lesson\\n   222\\t│   ├── Submits a quiz\\n   223\\t│   └── Views lesson content\\n   224\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n   225\\t│   ├── Check if user has activity today (UTC+7)\\n   226\\t│   ├── IF first activity today:\\n   227\\t│   │   ├── IF yesterday had activity: current_streak += 1\\n   228\\t│   │   ├── ELSE IF missed 1 day AND has freeze: use freeze, keep streak\\n   229\\t│   │   └── ELSE: current_streak = 1\\n   230\\t│   ├── Update longest_streak if current > longest\\n   231\\t│   └── Update last_active_at = now()\\n   232\\t└── Store last_streak_date in user record\\n   233\\t```\\n   234\\t\\n   235\\t#### D.2 Streak API\\n   236\\t```\\n   237\\tREQ-STREAK-002: GET /api/v1/users/me/streak\\n   238\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   239\\t│   ├── current_streak: int\\n   240\\t│   ├── longest_streak: int\\n   241\\t│   ├── last_active_date: date\\n   242\\t│   ├── streak_freezes_available: int (max 2)\\n   243\\t│   ├── streak_at_risk: bool (true if no activity today and streak > 0)\\n   244\\t│   └── days_until_next_badge: int\\n   245\\t└── Include streak badge progress\\n   246\\t\\n   247\\tREQ-STREAK-003: POST /api/v1/users/me/streak/freeze\\n   248\\t├── WHEN user activates streak freeze\\n   249\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\\n   250\\t│   ├── Decrement streak_freezes_available\\n   251\\t│   ├── Set streak_frozen_until = tomorrow\\n   252\\t│   └── Return updated streak info\\n   253\\t└── IF no freezes available THEN return 400\\n   254\\t```\\n   255\\t\\n   256\\t---\\n   257\\t\\n   258\\t### 2.5 DOMAIN E: URN & MOTIF APIS\\n   259\\t\\n   260\\t#### E.1 Urns Listing\\n   261\\t```\\n   262\\tREQ-URN-001: GET /api/v1/urns\\n   263\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return all 9 urns with:\\n   264\\t│   ├── id, slug, name, name_han\\n   265\\t│   ├── represents, description\\n   266\\t│   ├── thumbnail_url, model_url\\n   267\\t│   ├── display_order\\n   268\\t│   ├── motif_count: int (total)\\n   269\\t│   └── user_progress: { discovered, learned, mastered } (if authenticated)\\n   270\\t└── Order by display_order ASC\\n   271\\t```\\n   272\\t\\n   273\\t#### E.2 Single Urn Detail\\n   274\\t```\\n   275\\tREQ-URN-002: GET /api/v1/urns/{slug}\\n   276\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return urn detail with:\\n   277\\t│   ├── All fields from URN-001\\n   278\\t│   ├── motifs: array (with progress status if authenticated)\\n   279\\t│   └── completion_percentage: float\\n   280\\t└── IF not found THEN return 404\\n   281\\t```\\n   282\\t\\n   283\\t#### E.3 Motif Detail\\n   284\\t```\\n   285\\tREQ-MOTIF-001: GET /api/v1/motifs/{motif_id}\\n   286\\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\\n   287\\t│   ├── id, urn_id, mesh_name, name, name_en\\n   288\\t│   ├── category, rarity\\n   289\\t│   ├── pos_x, pos_y, pos_z, bounding_radius\\n   290\\t│   ├── cam_pos_x, cam_pos_y, cam_pos_z\\n   291\\t│   ├── cam_look_at_x, cam_look_at_y, cam_look_at_z\\n   292\\t│   ├── thumbnail_url, silhouette_url\\n   293\\t│  